tial interior project in Green Park, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Residential Interior in Green Park\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How do I find the best interior designers in Hauz Khas?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Visit or review finished projects, check how detailed their drawings are, and ask who supervises work on site. Clear communication matters as much as good taste.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you design builder floors and apartments in South Delhi?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. We design builder floors and apartments in Hauz Khas, Green Park, Safdarjung Enclave and nearby areas, planning storage and light carefully because these homes often have tight layouts.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can you work with furniture I already own?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. We review what you have, keep the pieces that work, and design new furniture and finishes around them.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What sets the best interior designers apart?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">They listen first, design for how you live, and stay on site until the last detail is finished, so the result matches the drawings.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Choose a Designer You Can Trust on Site</h2>\n            <p>The best interior designers are judged by finished rooms and satisfied clients, not by sample photos. Ask to see work, ask how problems are handled, and compare what each quote includes.</p><p>Planning work in Hauz Khas? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Meet the 9th Corner team</a> for a first chat about your space.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}